# app/ ships now — vercel.json builds it and serves app/dist. Vercel excludes
# node_modules and the build output on its own, so only sources go up.
#
# site/ is NOT ignored and must not be: the Vite build copies its 28 MB of
# imagery into app/dist, so the tree has to be there at build time even though
# none of its .dc.html pages is served any more.
